--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS FOR YOUR ANDROID PHONE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Download this file (khelarena-esports.apk) directly to your Android device.
2. If installing for the first time, enable "Install from Unknown Sources" in:
   Settings > Security > Install Unknown Apps > [Your Browser or File Manager]
3. Tap on the downloaded file to begin the native package installation.
4. Open KhelArena Esports from your home screen and sign in securely.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROGRESSIVE WEB APPLICATION (PWA) MOBILE INSTALLATION (RECOMMENDED)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
You can also install KhelArena Esports instantly with Native WebAPK integration:
1. Open the App in Chrome or Samsung Internet on your Android device:
   https://ais-pre-j5vaxbj5vlrieqvuq5jaxc-678267238933.asia-east1.run.app
2. Tap the menu icon (three dots) in your browser.
3. Select "Add to Home Screen" or "Install App".
4. Android will generate a lightweight, secure native WebAPK with the app's
   official logo icon and standalone full-screen window configuration.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMPILING A CUSTOM NATIVE APK USING CAPACITOR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
If you want to compile a signed production-ready binary from this codebase:
1. Install Capacitor CLI:
   npm install @capacitor/core @capacitor/cli @capacitor/android
2. Initialize Capacitor:
   npx cap init KhelArena com.khelarena.esports --web-dir=dist
3. Build the React project:
   npm run build
4. Add the Android platform:
   npx cap add android
5. Copy static assets to the Android project:
   npx cap sync android
6. Open the project in Android Studio to build your production .apk / .aab:
   npx cap open android

